; vm/dune:  brisk_vm, the machine of M0 (D-D-33).
; The module list stays open, so assemble.ml and exec.ml join the
; library without an edit of this file, which is how lib/dune and
; surface/dune are written (D-A-12).
; The library is unwrapped, so Instr, Value and Prim name themselves in
; test/ (D-A-11).
; -warn-error +a is the "warnings as errors" of M0-PLAN.md:245 (D-A-10).

(library
 (name brisk_vm)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries brisk_core)
 (flags (:standard -warn-error +a)))
